{"code":"432980","name":"엠에프씨","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"제약","sector_desc":"의약품을 개발·생산·판매. 신약 파이프라인과 임상 결과, 약가 정책에 주가가 크게 반응합니다.","desc":"동사는 2008년 설립된 원료의약품 및 소재개발 전문 기업으로, 2024년 코스닥시장에 상장함. 유기합성, 대량생산 등 기술로 API, KSM, PI 등을 개발·양산하며, 심혈관계·만성기관지염 관련 37개 원료의약품을 식약처에 등록하여 생산·판매하고 있음. 신규 결정형 및 신규염 개발로 개량신약원료 사업을 추진하고, 선제적 IP 확보로 시장 선점 및 가격 주도권을 추구하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":2430.0,"open":2235.0,"high":2495.0,"low":2215.0,"volume":8555,"amount":20788650.0,"ret_1d":6.8132,"gap":-1.7582,"range_pct":11.5226,"ret_5":-11.7967,"ret_20":-7.2519,"ret_60":-10.6618,"ret_120":-33.2418,"ret_250":-38.481,"ma20":2540.25,"ma60":2582.25,"ma120":2794.625,"ma200":3085.475,"close_vs_ma200":-21.2439,"close_vs_ma60":-5.896,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-16.5111,"r2_60":0.068,"slope_120":-45.6605,"r2_120":0.5882,"slope_250":-36.5868,"r2_250":0.7746,"high52":4530.0,"low52":2215.0,"pos_52w":9.2873,"dd_52w":-46.3576,"mdd_1y":-43.3375,"atr14_pct":8.833,"vol_ann_60":82.8243,"vol_avg20":11695.75,"vol_ratio20":0.7315,"vr5":0.5002,"vr20":0.4138,"amount_avg5":20722486.0,"amount_avg20":29670312.0,"amount_avg60":47054658.6667,"obv_chg20":-16.2927,"turnover_20":2.7226,"pv_eff_20":-2.6636,"rsi14":45.9317,"frgn_net_5":-1473.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0171,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0171,"frgn_net_20":7613.0,"inst_net_20":-1131.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0886,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0132,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0754,"frgn_net_60":-72253.0,"inst_net_60":-15000.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.841,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.1746,"smart_net_60_pct":-1.0155,"frgn_net_120":-39540.0,"inst_net_120":-51110.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.4602,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.5949,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.0551,"foreign_ratio":0.46,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.88,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":2.0,"op_margin_q":3.3333,"op_qoq":166.6667,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":-66.6667,"rev_yoy":11.1111,"op_trend_4q":32.0,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-2.07,"debt_ratio":16.34,"per":null,"pbr":0.66,"div_